TITLE:: InsightMeterView
summary:: the levels and loudness pane of an Insight window
categories:: Libraries>Insight
related:: Classes/Insight, Classes/InsightPanel

DESCRIPTION::
A bar per channel in dBFS - rms solid, the true peak pale above it, the highest since reset a white line and a number on top, a light that turns red past the ceiling - and two bars for momentary and short term loudness in LUFS, with the target across them as an outlined band and the ceiling dashed across the channels.

A UserView the link::Classes/InsightPanel:: puts in a titled pane. It reads the insight and draws what it finds; the panel's updater calls refresh.

table::
## strong::drag on the channels:: || the ceiling (link::Classes/Insight#-ceiling::); shift: finer
## strong::drag on M and S:: || the target (link::Classes/Insight#-target::); shift: finer
## strong::wheel:: || the same side, in 0.5 dB / 1 LU steps
## strong::double click:: || -1 dBTP on the channels, -14 LUFS on M and S
## strong::click:: || drop what is held (link::Classes/Insight#-resetPeaks::)
::

